### User Service, 3001

### A. Reg
POST http://localhost:3001/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "elek@gmail.com", "name": "Teszt Elek", "password": "secret123" }

### B. Login
# @name login
POST http://localhost:3001/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "elek@gmail.com", "password": "secret123" }


### Payment Service, 3003

### 1. Sikeres fizetés → 201, APPROVED
POST http://localhost:3003/payments
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
Idempotency-Key: kulcs-1

{ "orderId": "order-1", "amount": 24990 }

### 2. még egyszer → 201, ua. az id, nincs új terhelés
POST http://localhost:3003/payments
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
Idempotency-Key: kulcs-1

{ "orderId": "order-1", "amount": 24990 }

### 3. ua a kulcs, más összeg → 422
POST http://localhost:3003/payments
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
Idempotency-Key: kulcs-1

{ "orderId": "order-1", "amount": 1 }

### 4. Kulcs nélkül → 400
POST http://localhost:3003/payments
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

{ "orderId": "order-1", "amount": 24990 }

### 5. Nincs fedezet → 201, DECLINED
POST http://localhost:3003/payments
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
Idempotency-Key: kulcs-2

{ "orderId": "order-2", "amount": 150000 }

### 6. A bank leáll → 502
POST http://localhost:3003/payments
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
Idempotency-Key: kulcs-3

{ "orderId": "order-3", "amount": 99999 }